  "claims": [
    {
      "id": "claim_014c14c574f9406c85bda06e7444fca2",
      "statement": "The Go surface is a Wails v3 desktop application that registers exactly two services, LoadoutService and EditService; the React frontend reaches them through Wails bindings rather than HTTP endpoints.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://SigilLoadout/main.go#L224-L231",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:e1de7a478e00e6561a3e9e6371858a0fa55ff7997f234e449be521b11570bc93:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_091366e8dc6b4da6b163d99144d20294",
      "statement": "Which records count as edits is decided by the frontend, not by Go: the Go read path performs no filtering and only pads values.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://SigilLoadout/editservice.go#L192-L201",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:5af26cc4a387b09a56730dd9c93ebdf5e1259ee757f90eaceced62caedb836bd:"
        },
        {
          "resource": "repo://SigilLoadout/editservice.go#L224-L226",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:21dadadc5219a0e4d2606cae625faacd3796ef0eb0f0b5753e7238d6e1c242c5:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_49f386e87af64302907170935741a1b7",
      "statement": "A file that exists but cannot be read or parsed is treated as an error rather than as an empty list, because an empty list is a real state (all edits switched off) and showing a broken file as empty is how one stray keystroke overwrites the user's edits.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://SigilLoadout/editservice.go#L198-L201",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:2d5a08f9ce2b1de11ee7ffa1f9dd821de3d7ef5a5b314fb6159577f80d50d1bd:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_768624bd6e0147148593ec7b92659939",
      "statement": "The frontend is state-free at the boundary: it calls SaveEdits on every change and never waits for an answer, so a write failure at flush time is surfaced to the frontend as the GBFR.SigilLoadout.SaveFailed event, whose name is mirrored in SigilEditorPanel.tsx with no coupling between the two files.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://SigilLoadout/editservice.go#L45-L47",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:1ae6cf74087376bcd4daa14718386bcab0d8ba8734d47ce60380f0ce1c8b1393:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_58ed993025894a9598d6c22d9c2a8fae",
      "statement": "nil and an empty list are distinct states in SaveEdits: nil means nothing was handed over and nothing is written, while an empty list writes a file with every edit switched off.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://SigilLoadout/editservice.go#L249-L251",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:a6c7548f92fbf4dd6bd2585bd7aa873aa204012e3996edb551e07300dcab3c7f:"
